  "title": "SIP6.1.2: Cross-chain Fleet Deployment: DAO_LazyVault_USDC_1 on mainnet",
  "description": "# SIP6.1.2: Cross-chain Fleet Deployment: DAO_LazyVault_USDC_1 on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to activate the DAO_LazyVault_USDC_1 Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nThis cross-chain fleet deployment will expand the protocol's capabilities across multiple networks.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0xd77F9a9F2b0C160dB3e9dC2Cce370c1a740C76fc\n- Buffer Ark: 0x2823E0d57609eD2276b46aa1Fc02fa06BF654C4a\n- Number of Arks: 21\n- Curator: 0x447BF9d1485ABDc4C1778025DfdfbE8b894C3796\n\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Add Fleet to Harbor Command\n2. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for BufferArk\n3. Add 21 Arks to the Fleet\n4. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for each Ark\n5. Grant CURATOR_ROLE to Curator for the Fleet\n\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n### Fleet Configuration\n- Deposit Cap: 0 (20000000000000 raw)\n- Initial Minimum Buffer Balance: 500 (500000000 raw)\n- Initial Rebalance Cooldown: 10 minutes (600 seconds)\n- Initial Tip Rate: 1% (10000000000000000 raw)\n\n",
